            ],
            "pages": {
              "end": 26,
              "start": 26
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kagan asked whether the agency\u2019s commenters understood the status quo they were asked to comment on."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Breyer",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ce3cd1733405b188e0515be120ce13532626827088b86f6d8a73518c41385c28",
