            "pages": {
              "end": 32,
              "start": 32
            }
          }
        ],
        "text": "Justice Kavanaugh asked whether the agency\u2019s approach was aimed at reducing spending on the program."
      },
      {
        "attribution": "Justice Kavanaugh",
        "citations": [
          {
            "document_hash": "ce3cd1733405b188e0515be120ce13532626827088b86f6d8a73518c41385c28",
